@startuml
!theme sunlust

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> CardInserted : insert card
CardInserted --> PINEntry : card read
PINEntry --> Valid : correct PIN
PINEntry --> Invalid : wrong PIN
Valid --> SelectService : authenticated
SelectService --> Processing : service selected
Processing --> Dispensing : process complete
Dispensing --> Complete : cash dispensed
Complete --> CardEject : transaction done
Invalid --> CardEject : too many attempts
CardEject --> Idle : card ejected

@enduml
